WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,110 --> 00:00:02,110
A few days ago, I went back to the dormitory to pick up things.

2
00:00:02,110 --> 00:00:04,110
Only to find you lying on the ground unconscious

3
00:00:04,110 --> 00:00:06,110
Send you to the hospital quickly

4
00:00:06,110 --> 00:00:07,110
I don't even dare to think about it now

5
00:00:07,110 --> 00:00:09,110
If I didn't go back that day

6
00:00:09,110 --> 00:00:15,950
How bad will things get? Jian Tong

7
00:00:15,950 --> 00:00:18,950
Why don't you thank this guy quickly?

8
00:00:18,950 --> 00:00:22,330
Qin Mumu Miss Qin

9
00:00:22,330 --> 00:00:23,330
Hello, little sir

10
00:00:23,330 --> 00:00:25,810
Miss Qin just said

11
00:00:25,810 --> 00:00:30,670
Jian Tong was ill and hospitalized a while ago, right?

12
00:00:30,670 --> 00:00:31,670
It rained that night

13
00:00:31,670 --> 00:00:32,670
Jian Tong got caught in the rain and had a fever

14
00:00:32,670 --> 00:00:34,670
I guess it’s because I couldn’t stand firm when I got up.

15
00:00:34,670 --> 00:00:35,670
Fell on the door handle

16
00:00:35,670 --> 00:00:36,670
When I took him to the hospital

17
00:00:36,670 --> 00:00:37,670
All worried to death

18
00:00:37,670 --> 00:00:45,560
Mr. Little

19
00:00:45,560 --> 00:00:47,850
If there's nothing to do, I'll go to work

20
00:00:47,850 --> 00:00:49,850
Why doesn't he pick me up?

21
00:00:49,850 --> 00:00:50,850
Why should he save me?

22
00:00:50,850 --> 00:00:52,880
This is more infuriating than being penetrated

23
00:00:52,880 --> 00:00:55,040
Are you busy next time?
